','FCC Academic Affairs & Faculty Board','Academic Curriculum & Syllabi','/api/courses?department={department}','Open / Patron Access',NULL,'{\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}','json','Accredited academic course catalog with syllabus outlines, prescribed reading lists, and assigned departmental lecturers.','#/hod/courses','Active',1,'2026-10-07 11:56:59','2026-10-07 11:56:59'),('API-CROSSREF','Crossref Global Scholarly Works API','Crossref Consortium (Oxford, UK & Lynnfield, USA)','Scholarly Research & DOIs','https://api.crossref.org/works?query={query}&rows=12','Free Open Access',NULL,NULL,'json','Official registry of 150M+ peer-reviewed journal papers, academic dissertations, and conference proceedings.','https://api.crossref.org/','Active',1,'2026-10-07 11:56:59','2026-10-07 11:56:59'),('API-DEPARTMENTS','Academic Departments & HOD Directory API','FCC Registry & Academic Directorate','Institutional Structure & Faculties','/api/departments','Institutional Directory',NULL,'{\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}','json','Directory of accredited academic departments, faculty allocations, student counts, and active Head of Department profiles.','#/admin/hod-submissions','Active',1,'2026-10-07 11:56:59','2026-10-07 11:56:59'),('API-DEPT-UPLOADS','Departmental Digital Materials Staging API','FCC HOD Academic Staging Directorate','Faculty Submissions & E-Texts','/api/department-uploads?department_id={id}','HOD Staff Credentials',NULL,'{\"Accept\":\"application/json\"}','json','Lecture handouts, seminar monographs, past exam question compendia, and digital textbooks uploaded by HODs.','#/hod/upload','Active',1,'2026-10-07 11:56:59','2026-10-07 11:56:59'),('API-DIRECTORY-OF-AF-827','Directory of African Open Access Journals (DAOR)','African Open Science Network','Pan-African Academic Journals','https://daor.africa/api/v1/search?q={query}','Free Open Access',NULL,NULL,'json','Registry of African peer-reviewed scholarly journals and research publications.','https://daor.africa/doc